LZ4 1.11.1 (https://github.com/lz4/lz4, release v1.11.1 of 10.11.2026, tag commit aa4647fad575d01a874aaaadcdbe8e6a40e072f5), unchanged: lib/lz4.c, lz4.h, lz4hc.c, lz4hc.h.
The release has no archive and no .sha256: the four files were read from the tag through GitHub's contents API and each one matches the git blob
hash the API names (lz4.c 2ab4a114f14143f901899c4bcd8aa18ee9ee866a, lz4.h e69ae5627dcee63f71c0a4e42c4c8c58f337426c, lz4hc.c
b394c3961d35d80a8e89a4b0838ff8eea42adfe6, lz4hc.h 1743673532aee7229a9a1b925f422be69a78bcc1). Licence of the library: BSD 2-Clause (see LICENSE, unchanged).
Used by src/lz4pack.c for the independent raw LZ4 blocks of the asset packs (AMPRPAK4). The runtime of drakmor's ampr_emu pins its
own decoder (v1.10.0): the block format has not changed since 2012, and test/lz4cross shows that blocks written by 1.11.1 are read by
1.11.0 and the other way round (see CHANGELOG; the same test showed it for 1.11.0 against 1.10.0). Added 12.10.2026 (1.10.0), 1.11.0 on 08.11.2026,
1.11.1 on 10.11.2026 (fixes LZ4_resetStreamHC() on dirty memory, an out-of-bounds write at levels >= 10 that 1.11.0 had; this app uses
LZ4_compress_HC_extStateHC, which initializes the state itself).
